# "Enchanted creature is a legendary ... in addition to its other types" (CR 205.3, layer 4): one Serum on one of Bot1's two
# Ornithopters leaves them different (only one is legendary), so both stay. The second Serum on the other makes both
# legendary with the same name, and the legend rule (CR 704.5j) has Bot1 keep one: the other goes to the graveyard, and its
# Serum, no longer attached to anything, follows (CR 704.5m). The survivor, a 2/4, attacks on turn 5 with no Equipment to
# choose, and Bot2 takes 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Super-Soldier Serum
Super-Soldier Serum
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

